units real
dimension 3
boundary f f f

atom_style molecular
read_data morse_bond.data

bond_style morse
bond_coeff 1 20.0 2.0 1.2

thermo 10
thermo_style custom step time temp ke pe ebond etotal

dump trajectory all custom 10 morse_bond.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz

fix integrator all nve

run 500
